{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56045","headline":"西林水阁 · 齐己","name":"西林水阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松楸连塔古，窗槛任闲开。\n水遶清阴里，人从热处来。\n噪风蝉带鹤，欹树石兼苔。\n向晓东林下，迟迟舍此廻。\n（以上二首均见《吉石庵丛书》本《庐山记》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}